response:
The report details cyberattacks targeting Ukrainian military personnel via the Signal messaging app. Attackers distributed malicious APK files disguised as Ukrainian military software systems: "GRISELDA" (distributing the HYDRA malware) and the surveillance system "Очі" (distributing a trojanized version of the app containing malicious Java classes). The activity involving the modified "Очі" application is tracked under the threat identifier UAC-0210.

